  ('AF-2-12-14', 'Boron (Non Chelated)', 'Micro Element Categories', 'Chelated Micro Element ( Single)', 'AK-BORE(Non Chelated) is an ideal boron fertilizer to correct boron deficiency in soil & crops. it increases profit by maximizing yield. Contains Water soluble Boron 20% Minimum. Boron :-The main function of Boron related to cell wall strengths & development, cell division, fruit & seed development, sugar translocation & hormone synthesis. The Boron requirement at flowering & seed set may be higher than that needed for vegetative growth. Boron (B) has a significant effect in pollen germination & pollen tube growth. The viability of pollen grains also decreases when B is deficient. Boron (B) deficiency increases the drop of buds & flowers, resulting in significant reduction in seed & fruit set & also in the quality of fruits, seeds, nuts etc. Boron maintains calcium (Ca) in soluble form & thus ensures its proper utilization.

Recommendations : Akshat AK Bore is foliar application fertilizers for Boron requirements of the crop. Apply 250 gm in 200 ltr of water for per acre during rapid growth and nutritional stress conditions. For optimum results, repeat application throught the growing season.', '[["Di Sodium Octa borate Tetra Hydrate","(Na22B8013,4H20)"],["Boron (as B) percent by weight, Minimum","20.00"],["Matter insoluble in water, percent by weight, maximum","1.0"],["Lead (asPb) percent by weight, Maximum","0.003"]]'::jsonb, 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/micro_element_categories/1580467214SEERIN-BORON-250G-CORRECTION.jpg', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/micro_element_categories/1644045884oron-New.pdf', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/products-view.php?category=2&products=12&productsId=14', '3105', 5, 'BAG', 360),
  ('AF-2-12-16', 'Iron EDDHA', 'Micro Element Categories', 'Chelated Micro Element ( Single)', 'Iron EDDHA', '[]'::jsonb, 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/micro_element_categories/16440463901639657852088-removebg-preview.png', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/micro_element_categories/1644046433e-EDDHA.pdf', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/products-view.php?category=2&products=12&productsId=16', '3105', 5, 'BAG', 370),
  ('AF-2-13-8', 'Akshat Combi-2', 'Micro Element Categories', 'Chelated Multimicro Nutrient (Mix )', 'Akshat Combi-2 products are the chelated multi micronutrient fertilizer with Magnesium and sulphur for the prophylactic and curative treatment of micronutrient deficiencies in intensive crop and field crops. its ideal complement for plant nutrition in a broad variety of crops, for optimal development and best yield. Intensive crop production calls for perfectly balanced nutrition that includes all plant essentials. Special care and reliable monitoring are required when it comes to micronutrient deficiencies, as they may impair plant growth. Even hidden deficiencies, with no visual symptoms, put yield levels and crop quality at risk.

Recommendations : As tank Mix Akshat Combi-2 is miscible with many crop protection agents but not with alkaline or those containing metallic trace elements eg. Copper or manganese A Mixing test with small amounts of product as intended is advisible. Small Doses applied frequently gives reliable action. Apply every 7-15 Days depending on the nutritional state of the crop.', '[["State Grade","Zn","Fe","Mn","Br","Cu","Mo"],["M.H .","3%","0.5%","1%","0.1%","0.5%","1%"],["C.G.","5.0%","4.0%","2.5%","0.1%","1.5%","0.8%"]]'::jsonb, 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/micro_element_categories/1579185136p-11.jpg', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/micro_element_categories/1644045033ombi-New.pdf', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/products-view.php?category=2&products=13&productsId=8', '3105', 5, 'BAG', 380),
  ('AF-2-13-15', 'Akshat combi - 2', 'Micro Element Categories', 'Chelated Multimicro Nutrient (Mix )', 'akshat combi - 2

