  ('AF-3-14-2', 'Urja', 'Secondary Fertilizers', 'Urja', 'akshat Urja is Magnesium and silicon-rich nutrients make crop production and immunity resistant. Oil seeds increase the quantity and quality of oil in the crop. Energy is a fertilizer used in crops rich in calcium magnesium and sulfur and silicon.With its use, the physical, chemical, and biological conditions of the soil are improved, as well as the soil of the P.H. is governed.', '[]'::jsonb, 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/secondary_fertilizers/1640844158Urja_41_11zon.jpeg', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/secondary_fertilizers/1646114092rja-New.pdf', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/products-view.php?category=3&products=14&productsId=2', '3101', 5, 'BAG', 400),
  ('AF-3-15-1', 'Amrutam Gold', 'Secondary Fertilizers', 'Amrutam Gold', 'Benefits ; * Make plants healthier * Reduce plants stress. * Good effect on root growth. * Safe to use on plants any time of the year.

Amrutam Gold is a natural seaweed plant stimulant that works by making plants healthier. it has an amazing effect on root growth,reduces plat stress and is safe to use on any plant at any time of the year.Amrutam gols is a natural product so has no with holding period or field re-entry restrictions. Amrutam gold also has the effect of enhancing fertilizer effeciency by stimulating root growth and plat activity. Helps plats establishment and reduces transplanting shock.Stimulates growth of white root and enhances flowering. Enhances soil microbial activity.', '[]'::jsonb, 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/secondary_fertilizers/1644057728Amrutam-Gold_23_11zon.jpeg', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/secondary_fertilizers/1645610971mrutam-New.pdf', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/products-view.php?category=3&products=15&productsId=1', '3101', 5, 'BAG', 410),
  ('AF-3-24-3', 'Myco-Ly', 'Secondary Fertilizers', 'Myco-Ly', 'Recommendations ; Akshat MRH-GR Specially designed for Vegetables & Paddy. Akshat MRH-GR is a Mycorhza. Its is helpful for Solublizing fix phosphate pertainting to the soil.

Benefits :

Boost natural defence against diseases.

Increase flowering, pollination and fruit setting

Activate anti-stress genes.

Improve quantity and quality of vegetables and paddy.

Reduce stress symptoms.', '[]'::jsonb, 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/secondary_fertilizers/1644062527Screenshot-2022-02-05-173015.png', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/uploads/secondary_fertilizers/1644055223yco-ly-New.pdf', 'https://www.akshatfertilizer.com/products-view.php?category=3&products=24&productsId=3', '3101', 5, 'BAG', 420),
